-- title:
--   Original zero-jump stopped Gaussian centred martingale dominates terminal plus physical cash
-- statement:
--   For the actual non-bounded-variation original Levy process with zero jump measure, the stopped discounted candidate terminal value plus true stopped dividend measure cash has an almost-everywhere affine upper bound by the initial candidate and an integrable centred original Gaussian martingale. The theorem retains exact original stopping, risk-process, cap, generator, dividend-atom and regularity conditions.
-- source:
--   Exact original theorem 4a61c53e-e305-4e4d-9204-393a6bc72400; meaningful sufficient one-martingale source, without artificial G/R slack.

import Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.ContDiff.Defs
import Mathlib.Analysis.Complex.Exponential
import Mathlib.MeasureTheory.MeasurableSpace.Defs
import Definitions.Def_AvramDividend_Classical_SpectrallyNegativeLevy
